    "title": "AKU Network of Teaching and Learning leading a transformative teaching initiative in Kenya",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The AKU Network of Teaching and Learning (TL_net) has embarked on a new initiative in collaboration with members from other universities in Kenya",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "f4c0f6d9b2395a80",
        "component": "news_media",
